Tuesday, August 15, 1989 was a very hot summer's day in California's Central Valley. Joseph Villa, not his real name, was driving near the 205 Highway in Stockton. with his wife and son when their car overheated. Joseph pulled over on a quiet side road and propped up the car's bonnet to inspect the damage. Realising it was too severe to fix without assistance, Joseph decided he and his son would walk to the nearest payphone to call for help while his wife waited at the car.
1989年8月15日，星期二，是加利福尼亚州中央谷地一个非常炎热的夏日。约瑟夫·维拉（化名）当时正带着妻子和儿子在斯托克顿的205号高速公路附近开车，这时他们的车过热了。约瑟夫把车停在一条安静的侧路上，撑起引擎盖检查损坏情况。意识到如果不寻求帮助就无法修复，约瑟夫决定他和儿子步行去最近的公用电话亭求助，而他的妻子则在车里等待。

3
00:01:44.000 --> 00:02:26.000
As the father and son headed down the dusty road in search of a phone, the boy noticed an old military fatigue. jacket in a camouflage print crumpled on the ground. A military-style unit patch was crudely sewn on it. He kicked at the jacket and revealed an unmarked VHS cassette tape bundled underneath. Curious about what might be on there, he and his dad took it with them to watch later. At home, the Villa family inserted the videotape into their VCR and hit play. They gathered around the television. It appeared to contain footage of a home movie.
当父子俩沿着尘土飞扬的道路寻找电话时，男孩注意到地上有一件皱巴巴的迷彩印花旧军用夹克。上面粗糙地缝着一个军用风格的部队徽章。他踢了踢夹克，露出了下面捆着的一盘未标记的 VHS 录像带。出于好奇，他和父亲把它带上，打算以后再看。回到家后，维拉一家把录像带放进录像机并按下播放键。他们围在电视机前。录像里似乎是家庭录像的片段。

4
00:02:26.000 --> 00:03:05.000
Whoever had shot it had done so outside at night. Most of their surroundings were shrouded in darkness, but in the centre of the screen, a short distance away from the cameraman, was a single-story ranch house. The entire building was on fire. Crackling sounds could be heard as the blaze overwhelmed the house's timber frame. The person behind the camera was clearly eager to record every second of the building's destruction. A male voice appeared in the background, seemingly narrating the unfolding disaster.
拍摄者是在晚上户外拍摄的。大部分环境都笼罩在黑暗中，但在屏幕中央，离摄影师不远的地方，有一栋单层牧场式房屋。整栋建筑都在燃烧。当大火吞噬房屋的木框架时，可以听到噼啪作响的声音。镜头后面的人显然急于记录下建筑被毁的每一秒。背景中出现了一个男人的声音，似乎在解说这场正在发生的灾难。

5
00:03:05.000 --> 00:04:20.000
His voice was hushed and his tone excited. Look at it. Look at the planet. This is my domain. My hair on me. I call hell my hair. The whole sky is black with smoke. It's joy of soul up. Anxious and that's the evil. It seemed as though the person who had filmed the fire was also the one responsible for starting it.
他的声音很低沉，语气很兴奋。“看着它。看着这个星球。这是我的领地。我的头发在我身上。我称地狱为我的头发。整个天空都被烟雾染黑了。这是灵魂的喜悦。焦虑，这就是邪恶。” 拍摄火灾的人似乎也是纵火的始作俑者。

