He began addressing somebody he called Omar. Look at it, Omar. This is what I've been doing. In a week's vacation, I said I'll do it. I said I'll do it. Soon, sirens could be heard as firefighters rushed to the scene. Their loud, wailing noise seemed to prompt neighborhood coyotes to howl in reply. The unseen narrator behind the camera continued to narrate the scene. The fire department was trying to put it out.
他开始对一个他称之为奥马尔的人说话。“看着它，奥马尔。这就是我一直在做的事。在一周的假期里，我说我会做到的。我说我会做到的。” 很快，随着消防员赶到现场，可以听到警笛声。他们那响亮、凄厉的噪音似乎引得附近的土狼嚎叫回应。镜头后面那个看不见的人继续解说着现场。消防部门正试图扑灭大火。

7
00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:37.000
What a laugh. Look out, but remember me tonight. Ladies and gentlemen, I'm just next. The tape then shifted to footage from the horror film A Nightmare on Elm Street, recorded straight off a televised airing. It wasn't clear if the Inferno footage had been taped over the movie or edited in for a reason. The Villa family were shocked and wasted no time in passing the tape along,
“真是可笑。小心点，但今晚记住我。女士们先生们，我就是下一个。” 随后，录像切换到了恐怖电影《猛鬼街》的片段，直接从电视转播中录制。目前尚不清楚地狱火的录像是否覆盖了电影，还是出于某种原因被剪辑进去的。维拉一家感到震惊，并立即将录像带交给了当局。

