watching it. Doug Allen, a law enforcement coordinator at the department, feared that the person responsible could go on to commit further more violent crimes. He was well aware that some of the law enforcement coordinator at the department, fear that the person responsible, criminals, such as New York serial killer son of Sam, had started their crime sprees with arson before moving on to murder. Doug Allen, quote, I think the person who made this videotape and is responsible for the fire will, without a doubt in my mind, continue to set fires.
该部门的执法协调员道格·艾伦担心，责任人可能会继续犯下更暴力的罪行。他很清楚，一些罪犯，例如纽约连环杀手“山姆之子”，在转向谋杀之前都是从纵火开始犯罪狂潮的。道格·艾伦说：“我认为制作这段录像带并对火灾负责的人，毫无疑问会继续纵火。”

